<h1 class="doc-h1">Skeleton</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    Worth knowing where this belongs: on static SSR the server finishes rendering before a byte reaches the browser, so a skeleton the server draws is one nobody sees. It is for <code>[up-placeholder]</code>, which means it lives in a <code>&lt;template&gt;</code>.
</p>

